# storm_core - the storm cell's own art: a tiny SOLID tetrahedron. A storm draws nothing of
# its own (nebula body, Typhon-beam lightning), but its object needs art the engine can bake:
# a flat single triangle (bolt_mote) hung the engine building its derived art - it has no
# volume. This one is a few units across on every axis.
mtllib storm_core.mtl
v 0 2 0
v -2 -1 -1.2
v 2 -1 -1.2
v 0 -1 2.3
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 0 1
usemtl storm_core
f 1/1 3/2 2/3
f 1/1 4/2 3/3
f 1/1 2/2 4/3
f 2/1 3/2 4/3
